# The shipped bundle is compared byte for byte against a fresh build by
# `bun run build:check`, which CI runs. Any line-ending translation on
# checkout makes the committed copy differ from a freshly built one and the
# check fails on that platform alone -- a false alarm that says "stale
# bundle" when nothing is stale. Marked so git never rewrites it.
canvas/dist/cli.js -text

# Snapshots are byte-compared too, by the render tests.
canvas/test/snapshots/__snapshots__/*.snap -text
